WEBVTT

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:39.570
To settle things with the digital Sacred Beasts,
Takao and the BBA team arrived at the Battle Tower.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.330
These guys sure are full of it.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.750
This'll be a good warm up!

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.960
Go, Shoot!

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.920
Shoot!

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:04.140
Team Psykick sent their robo
Bladers in with a surprise attack...

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:15.780
but with the help of Ozma's team, we were able to move on and start Max and Jim's battle.

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:18.070
--Go, Shoot!

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:02.910
Max was in real trouble against the
overwhelming power of the digital Sacred Beast

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:06.740
but right when his victory
was all but confirmed...

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:09.870
The digital Sacred Beast got
right back on its feet!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:16.170
This room has a repair system for
the digital Sacred Beast installed in it!

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:49.200
Unbelievable!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:52.330
All of its data has been restored!

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.580
Is that even possible?

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:56.250
So he can't win no matter
how many times he beats it?

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.050
That's cheating!

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.840
Why don't you
try fighting fairly?

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:07.430
Silence! This is battle is a deathmatch!
It's kill or be killed!

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:10.310
Do whatever it takes to win!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.640
That's the very definition
of a deathmatch!

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:15.400
Now go, defeat Genbu!

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:20.150
Go, Cyber Draciel!
Grind Genbu into mincemeat!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.040
Go! Tear him to pieces!

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:52.640
Go for it, Max!

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:54.730
You can't lose to him!

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.150
Max!

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:59.320
You guys...

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:00.820
I won't lose...

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:03.240
I will never... Ever...

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:04.530
Lose!

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:15.830
Genbu has no chance against
a restored digital Sacred Beast!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:20.130
Go! Crush him!

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.630
Genbu!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.010
Genbu is losing power!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:34.060
He's going to lose if this keeps up!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:38.060
Max! Don't lose to
some digital Sacred Beast!

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.400
You can do it!

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.770
Max!

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:44.190
I will tear you to pieces!

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:49.450
I can't lose here...

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.370
I won't give in!

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.950
Go, Cyber Draciel!
Finish him off!

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.460
--Max!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:03.000
I refuse to lose!!

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.220
What?!

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:18.060
You did it, Max!
Time to fight back!

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:21.480
I will never lose to you!

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.320
Where's this power
coming from?!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.740
Go, Draciel!

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:37.290
Keep it up, Max!

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:39.870
Keep attacking and don't stop!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.960
Wow! I never thought...

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:47.920
Genbu had this kind of power...!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:53.220
What's going on?
Where was he hiding all that power?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.770
Fortress Defense!

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:13.450
He did it!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.290
There's no way...

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:22.670
My Cyber Draciel...!

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:34.930
Way to go, Max!

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:38.220
You won!
For real this time!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.640
He won! He finally won!

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:44.310
Max!

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:45.820
Guys!

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:47.780
Well done, Max!

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.320
That was one
heck of a comeback!

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:53.110
Yeah! And we'll win the next one, too!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:54.490
--Yeah!

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.840
You gotta be kidding me...

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:29.900
See that?
Our digital Sacred Beasts are immortal!

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:35.320
You're done for, this time!

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:39.120
I'll fight you as many
times as it takes.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.290
Keep bringing it on!

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.370
Max, stop!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:45.170
There's no end to this!

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:48.210
You'll lose Genbu if you keep going!

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:49.710
Max!

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:55.050
--Three! Two! One!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.760
Max!!

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:59.050
--Go, Shoot!

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.680
Let's break the repair system!

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:03.930
--Yeah!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:08.150
Hang in there, Max.
We're about to help you out!

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.980
Go, Shoot!

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:10.940
Dranzer!

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:11.860
Driger!

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:13.320
Dragoon!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.620
Not even a scratch...

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.530
Shoot!

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:23.830
Fools. We've taken your power into calculation.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:24.910
Doctor!

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:25.750
What?

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:26.870
Look here.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:32.130
Finally, some peace and quiet.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:34.090
What a waste of time.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.430
What powerful Bladers!

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:40.470
To defeat all those Beyblades
with just the four of them...

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:43.680
Let's go. We're going to back up Kinomiya.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:46.390
I'm coming, too!

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:49.230
Don't let them into
the battle room!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:57.780
No!

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:06.290
Crap! Won't even budge!

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.040
We're stuck here!

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.750
I'll handle this.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:22.640
Go, Cyber Draciel!
Defeat Genbu!

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.150
Max!

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:31.650
You've gotta stop!

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:32.900
Max!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:37.570
Sorry, guys.
If I give up here, it's all over.

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.610
I won't give up...

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.070
Never...

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:47.370
Yes! Keep it up!
Blow him away!

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.670
Darn it!

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.340
No! He can't take any more!

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.090
--Max!!

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.720
Time to wrap this up.

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:05.640
Go, Cyber Draciel! End this!

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:14.900
Max, you gotta run!

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:17.230
Run, Max!

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.200
Max!!

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:23.120
I will not lose...

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:24.780
Never!

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.450
Is he...?

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:29.910
Send him to hell!

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:32.540
Genbu!!

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:39.630
What?!

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.630
Go!!

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.140
What?!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:00.780
Max!!!

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:10.960
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:47.780
Go, my Genbu!!

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:03.470
Cyber Draciel!

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:05.180
This time...

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.300
You won't get
back up this time!

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:14.390
Genbu is losing power!

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.650
Genbu's going to wear
out if he keeps going!

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.020
Stop it, Max!

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:20.940
Don't be crazy!

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.440
Max!

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:25.490
I will not lose to a
digital Sacred Beast!

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.450
I have to defeat you!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.140
Look!

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:57.480
Did he win?

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.390
I won!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.470
Genbu! Draciel!

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:49.280
Boot up the backup computers!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:06.590
I won! My Cyber Draciel won!

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.480
Genbu!

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:25.020
--Genbu!

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.940
I won't let you--

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:38.660
Genbu...

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:49.970
We finally got one!
Genbu is ours!

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:57.470
With the digital Sacred Beast repair systems,
obtaining the four is trivial!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:59.770
Hurry up and get the
next stadium set up!

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:02.520
We can't! The repair system won't activate!

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:03.600
What?!

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:07.400
The main server has taken
damage from that last shock.

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.690
So just fix it!

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:09.990
We can't, sir.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:11.950
Impossible!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.410
Doctor?

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:16.330
Not to worry, Mr. Gideon.

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:19.750
I've got plenty of backup plans.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.170
They took it...

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:27.500
They took Genbu...

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:31.550
You goddamn incompetent piece of--

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.600
Let me go! Stop it!

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:39.470
He let them
take Genbu!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:43.810
Do you even know how
important the Sacred Beasts are?!

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:46.860
We were fools to trust you!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:51.400
If you idiots didn't have the
Sacred Beasts, Genbu would be--

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.440
Damn it all!

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.860
Hey, you!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.950
Shut your mouth
and listen to me!

00:16:57.070 --> 00:17:01.040
Do you know how hard
of a battle Max fought?

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.710
Or what dirty tricks
his opponent pulled?

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:07.000
If it wasn't for that weird machine...

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.340
Weird machine?

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:10.590
It was a digital Sacred
Beast repair system.

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:13.420
It gets back up no matter
how many times you beat it.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.930
Yeah! If it wasn't for that,
Max would have won!

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.760
Max should have won!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.810
So what?!

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:23.770
Doesn't change the fact
that Genbu got taken!

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:26.350
We're not battling for fun here!

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:27.690
What?!

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:29.400
Takao, stop it.

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.940
Dunga's right.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:35.610
No excuses. A loss is a loss.

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:39.120
I lost to the digital Sacred Beast.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.330
Max...

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.370
I lost.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:46.250
And they took Genbu. That's that.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.500
Not exactly.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.040
Max.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:54.880
You taught us a lesson
by sacrificing Genbu.

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:58.590
We can try and overpower
the digital Sacred Beasts,

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:01.390
and they can pull all
the tricks they want.

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.720
But the one thing we
absolutely cannot do

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:06.390
is give up the fight.

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:07.770
Kai...

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:13.400
You're right, Kai.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.110
That's it, Max!

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:17.990
I realized this during your battle.

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:22.830
We can fight the digital Sacred
Beasts on the same level!

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:24.330
He's right!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.910
We can't let those digital
Sacred Beasts beat us!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.250
Yeah.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:31.250
You gave us courage, Max!

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:32.880
The courage to fight!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.550
We can win!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:36.800
You guys...

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:39.010
Don't worry, Max.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.930
We'll get Genbu back.

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:43.510
Takao...

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:47.640
Okay, let's get going!

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:49.730
We're gonna win this next one!

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.650
Do you plan to continue?

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:53.820
We can't leave now!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.820
No point in stopping you.

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:57.820
Yup!

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:59.150
Don't lose.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:06.700
You bet.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:10.210
Let's go, guys! We gotta do it! For Max!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.120
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:12.420
Ozma!!

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:14.670
Should we really let them go?

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:16.630
They'll be fine.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:18.800
Sure you aren't overestimating them?

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:20.930
I just might be.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:24.850
Okay! We're going, too. To search for Genbu.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:27.430
He should be somewhere in this tower!

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:32.650
--Flash Leopard!
--Voltic Ape!

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:35.150
--Sharcrash!
--Vanishing Moot!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:44.740
Let's move!

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.040
What?

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.090
This is it.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:05.300
You guys okay?

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.970
Surprisingly.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:10.140
There's no end to the lows
they'll drop to, is there?

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:13.020
But now we can move
around a little easier!

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:17.650
I imagine they think we've fallen.

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:20.240
And that's when we
take back Genbu.

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:21.610
Yeah.

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.660
We can go from there.

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.870
Let's go.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:31.290
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:43.430
Welcome to the second battle arena.

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:47.850
So sorry, Max.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:50.640
But you fought a wonderful battle.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:55.230
I'll applaud you from the other
side for such a wonderful battle.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:59.610
Oh, shut up! You can take
your applause and shove it!

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:03.860
We're gonna whoop your digital Sacred Beasts this time, so get ready!

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:09.160
Well, well. Then I'll be able to
see another entertaining battle...

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.170
That's...

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:27.640
Salima?

00:22:59.730 --> 00:23:03.150
Rei has a hard battle to fight against Salima,
whose personality seems to

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:05.730
have been changed quite a
bit by the digital Sacred Beast.

00:23:05.730 --> 00:23:08.950
Is there a reason Rei
can't get serious?

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:11.450
In the next episode,
"Rei" fights with "delay"!

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:16.080
I'd like to go take a bath, "okay"?
How's that sound, Chairman?

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:18.580
Huh? Where's the Chairman?
